msgid "Trained on %(trained)s days, training planned on %(planned)s days."
msgstr ""
"An %(trained)s Tagen trainiert, an %(planned)s Tagen war Training geplant."

msgid "Assign a program"
msgstr "Programm zuweisen"

#| msgid ""
#| "Every athlete gets an own copy of the program for this period. Later changes"
#| " to the template do not change the copies. Invited members who have not "
#| "accepted yet receive nothing."
msgid ""
"Every athlete gets an own copy of the program for this period. Later changes"
" to the plan do not change the copies. Invited members who have not accepted"
" yet receive nothing."
msgstr ""
"Jeder Athlet erhält für diesen Zeitraum eine eigene Kopie des Programms. "
"Spätere Änderungen am Plan ändern die Kopien nicht. Eingeladene Mitglieder, "
"die noch nicht angenommen haben, erhalten nichts."

msgid "Assign"
msgstr "Zuweisen"

msgid ""
"You have no plans yet. Create a program and save it as a template to reuse "
"it as a plan."
msgstr ""
"Du hast noch keine Pläne. Erstelle ein Programm und speichere es als "
"Vorlage, um es als Plan wiederzuverwenden."

